[
  {
    "id": "auto-01",
    "text": "ಅಣ್ಣ, ಇಂದಿರಾನಗರಕ್ಕೆ ಹೋಗಿ.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "40be4fba34fc8e0da6ce3ed6ebaf76b26ef6addca6bd79d1ab9c924f66dd2466",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/auto-01.mp3",
      "assets/audio/auto-01-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "auto-02",
    "text": "ಅಣ್ಣ, ಓಟಿಪಿ ನಾಲ್ಕು, ಎಂಟು, ಎರಡು, ಆರು.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "1e5f69d8456b98be679d28e9fa1a392ea115de676f77f78153ac2e48eddecf80",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/auto-02.mp3",
      "assets/audio/auto-02-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "auto-03",
    "text": "ಅಣ್ಣ, ಎಡಕ್ಕೆ ತಿರುಗಿ.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "54f3796f9cbd7eefbf6f96d9ab780331d936c9abaade1aeda6147034d96a0c34",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/auto-03.mp3",
      "assets/audio/auto-03-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "auto-04",
    "text": "ಅಣ್ಣ, ಬಲಕ್ಕೆ ತಿರುಗಿ.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "72144af8c78b1429bc76f303c19056b3ff097f3b0e95134ae4568b040ca52083",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/auto-04.mp3",
      "assets/audio/auto-04-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "auto-05",
    "text": "ನೇರವಾಗಿ ಹೋಗಿ.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "b7de6048ef9b40554882278dbff10ceffdd2361174235943ea10e4e51899906d",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/auto-05.mp3",
      "assets/audio/auto-05-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "auto-06",
    "text": "ಸ್ವಲ್ಪ ನಿಧಾನವಾಗಿ ಹೋಗಿ.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "45f64a5e1a9d66c6ff242f5ab5befb3549a03dc63f5573be2d8608c03a0c34e0",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/auto-06.mp3",
      "assets/audio/auto-06-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "auto-07",
    "text": "ಸ್ವಲ್ಪ ಕಾಯಿರಿ.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "13e4f3827ab552de5b6acb9d960377f586554c30dae076287fbcfe3d029bfd0a",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/auto-07.mp3",
      "assets/audio/auto-07-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "auto-08",
    "text": "ಅಣ್ಣ, ಇಲ್ಲಿ ನಿಲ್ಲಿಸಿ.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "cd4b64eff3a8b09b3281b1f3f18a1cc0bae7741d42ee892876d328e2bfe6f852",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/auto-08.mp3",
      "assets/audio/auto-08-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "auto-09",
    "text": "ಎಷ್ಟು ಆಯಿತು?",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "dbb936deec0acaf692685546ce8330d64ab72171e6aef6b1051622e073086bc2",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/auto-09.mp3",
      "assets/audio/auto-09-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "auto-10",
    "text": "ಯುಪಿಐ ಮೂಲಕ ಕೊಡಬಹುದಾ?",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "85b147fb2d6f69be3e20095fde3df178114f4fbbdcec36d0c67e55bc12515b61",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/auto-10.mp3",
      "assets/audio/auto-10-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "breakfast-01",
    "text": "ಎರಡು ಇಡ್ಲಿ ಕೊಡಿ.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "f3762b9a026b7130902f7383c1cf64d30e3ec26e7373f8f1236f8a3b53854024",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/breakfast-01.mp3",
      "assets/audio/breakfast-01-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "breakfast-02",
    "text": "ಒಂದು ದೋಸೆ ಕೊಡಿ.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "c8230bda1cbfb241b67cc970e8d9d38cf1b46cc0f3355efe99f26fc5ceae878f",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/breakfast-02.mp3",
      "assets/audio/breakfast-02-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "breakfast-03",
    "text": "ಒಂದು ಕಾಫಿ ಕೊಡಿ.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "f029315d7a97f935ce7a38e6d2f8377a6479ff3e6adb463894f25f07792b8cab",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/breakfast-03.mp3",
      "assets/audio/breakfast-03-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "breakfast-04",
    "text": "ಸ್ವಲ್ಪ ನೀರು ಕೊಡಿ.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "e29001344ed5f6dd5ca6e52223a3de999489d13dd74f5fab8545441465c01c23",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/breakfast-04.mp3",
      "assets/audio/breakfast-04-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "breakfast-05",
    "text": "ಸಕ್ಕರೆ ಕಡಿಮೆ ಹಾಕಿ.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "0517b3dc3489204ba713b8bffa0575bb2c56ab64a5b21d93b390cdfce2a7860f",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/breakfast-05.mp3",
      "assets/audio/breakfast-05-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "breakfast-06",
    "text": "ಖಾರ ಕಡಿಮೆ ಮಾಡಿ.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "5c299780fe71726de17738b2c28e576ba9f42cd83793ca421e1cae234fcdd4f9",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/breakfast-06.mp3",
      "assets/audio/breakfast-06-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "breakfast-07",
    "text": "ಏನು ಇದೆ?",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "c24c59a82a56c0e77f2e38d0fa49c8ffbe1c164732975b41346da904639984ed",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/breakfast-07.mp3",
      "assets/audio/breakfast-07-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "breakfast-08",
    "text": "ಪಾರ್ಸೆಲ್ ಮಾಡಿ.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "de5158565be715a54fa1400179efdf02c6bc7a74cf38c24d9a53450b6bd44852",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/breakfast-08.mp3",
      "assets/audio/breakfast-08-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "breakfast-09",
    "text": "ಬಿಲ್ ಕೊಡಿ.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "ffcd30d0337bfdd57ce08bed1bc0e5ca74a5ebc7e5d0d01272ab0a18ae516ed5",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/breakfast-09.mp3",
      "assets/audio/breakfast-09-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "breakfast-10",
    "text": "ತುಂಬಾ ಧನ್ಯವಾದಗಳು.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "d83eab9126bd87d8a50363e55830b45257283d207792dd9d4db268fbfa117059",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/breakfast-10.mp3",
      "assets/audio/breakfast-10-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "groceries-01",
    "text": "ಟೊಮಾಟೊ ಇದೆಯಾ?",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "9d0967da2677bdfa05eb03aa9eb35dd4518912b6ef6a6181dbe2ce0a0134669e",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/groceries-01.mp3",
      "assets/audio/groceries-01-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "groceries-02",
    "text": "ಇದು ಎಷ್ಟು?",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "42be6bb972616111418cf72d8143ad163520c7108fbebc85b9d420c3816f5c77",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/groceries-02.mp3",
      "assets/audio/groceries-02-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "groceries-03",
    "text": "ಅರ್ಧ ಕಿಲೋ ಕೊಡಿ.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "c2aa2745d6d911ce216c35ba5dda3a8715a6588cb05f0a80c8fc1b1e5fc6b059",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/groceries-03.mp3",
      "assets/audio/groceries-03-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "groceries-04",
    "text": "ಒಂದು ಕಿಲೋ ಕೊಡಿ.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "6ac4fa9c3d4728dd0ad5533c1fccd4d4984979d8efe409cc2ade7f181d34da81",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/groceries-04.mp3",
      "assets/audio/groceries-04-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "groceries-05",
    "text": "ಬೇರೆ ಏನಾದರೂ ಇದೆಯಾ?",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "51fdc4a3b1f10fe86a2ad0eb345f32dc0cc1a07e2196bb3ecb38b1eff093fef1",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/groceries-05.mp3",
      "assets/audio/groceries-05-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "groceries-06",
    "text": "ಚೀಲ ಬೇಡ.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "adf0964df0c0944536d6f7b62fb3707e672675624e42ec8cb57a01d04716bf25",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/groceries-06.mp3",
      "assets/audio/groceries-06-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "groceries-07",
    "text": "ಒಟ್ಟು ಎಷ್ಟು?",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "68bbcaf44950cf23937c672730d0a21419be57a9f97e6e9d228d121a19c0b7bf",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/groceries-07.mp3",
      "assets/audio/groceries-07-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "groceries-08",
    "text": "ಯುಪಿಐ ಇದೆಯಾ?",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "65634221e3846888d4c1930212ff9f98beeb9edc1886c5628778733c040dc163",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/groceries-08.mp3",
      "assets/audio/groceries-08-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "groceries-09",
    "text": "ಚಿಲ್ಲರೆ ಕೊಡಿ.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "8165609023e1360a8c1a5a5f840543ea50986dd945fec4cdfd4b8ec67226c419",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/groceries-09.mp3",
      "assets/audio/groceries-09-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "groceries-10",
    "text": "ರಸೀದಿ ಕೊಡಿ.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "3730c53699f812d0594b2c5db51b32b1ef1cf090de22a9a8230f2882d33fbb93",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/groceries-10.mp3",
      "assets/audio/groceries-10-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "transit-01",
    "text": "ಈ ಬಸ್ ಮೆಜೆಸ್ಟಿಕ್‌ಗೆ ಹೋಗುತ್ತಾ?",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "375fde82d58f09170c6485b6b0563a290cb1bb6d85aa3740ab4eb1750bfdb5d0",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/transit-01.mp3",
      "assets/audio/transit-01-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "transit-02",
    "text": "ಯಾವ ಪ್ಲಾಟ್‌ಫಾರ್ಮ್?",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "d31eea21f646d1d858605d01b77efc1f9285355f738315986094a15966062e44",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/transit-02.mp3",
      "assets/audio/transit-02-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "transit-03",
    "text": "ಒಂದು ಟಿಕೆಟ್ ಕೊಡಿ.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "ba2214c072387c0b8e9072583ac2436c754325aef75720b74d671978ca3c780a",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/transit-03.mp3",
      "assets/audio/transit-03-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "transit-04",
    "text": "ಟಿಕೆಟ್ ಎಷ್ಟು?",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "be3ae69d2a3d4157e82c39cdedfefdc1998f246b35bb649a8a50f7acc872eadd",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/transit-04.mp3",
      "assets/audio/transit-04-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "transit-05",
    "text": "ಬಸ್ ಯಾವಾಗ ಹೊರಡುತ್ತೆ?",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "0627c756f244e23c0df6a94d840c8a6100cc03d9663f40e5b6e1f8801cc60e71",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/transit-05.mp3",
      "assets/audio/transit-05-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "transit-06",
    "text": "ಮುಂದಿನ ನಿಲ್ದಾಣ ಯಾವುದು?",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "db8166f731b7fc1bf93f1841f7c8dab71822b246e80dfaf10bee2a46a08f0144",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/transit-06.mp3",
      "assets/audio/transit-06-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "transit-07",
    "text": "ನಾನು ಇಲ್ಲಿ ಇಳಿಯಬೇಕು.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "5c800734cd5a353c9336659a40163a65f994b7af0fa95cc4d19ce64a3c99c634",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/transit-07.mp3",
      "assets/audio/transit-07-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "transit-08",
    "text": "ಸ್ವಲ್ಪ ಸಹಾಯ ಮಾಡಿ.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "4da686a3ab27b9d089a2e9a138f43aa80d99a3f7a106953d98a1e7156fc6bcc1",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/transit-08.mp3",
      "assets/audio/transit-08-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "transit-09",
    "text": "ಮೆಟ್ರೋ ನಿಲ್ದಾಣ ಎಲ್ಲಿದೆ?",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "3257747ead98f0606e933ccb80a1bda2c718540669d28f0653ad3f4761f9fbb1",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/transit-09.mp3",
      "assets/audio/transit-09-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "transit-10",
    "text": "ಸೀಟು ಇದೆಯಾ?",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "ac5d8f299c210b9ae316e972d5c7461edb72c6e63bfd01fdf25f0fc443a0119a",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/transit-10.mp3",
      "assets/audio/transit-10-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "delivery-01",
    "text": "ನೀವು ಎಲ್ಲಿದ್ದೀರಾ?",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "5a642d9dda8c334be27da5fc01f52e3742d4e363a7aca2dfbb110b6f2c6262b4",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/delivery-01.mp3",
      "assets/audio/delivery-01-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "delivery-02",
    "text": "ಅಂಗಡಿ ಹತ್ತಿರ ಬನ್ನಿ.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "be3b727ea70eaa627378e53bced40ef695f67868711fb793e2a3d36d38fe64ed",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/delivery-02.mp3",
      "assets/audio/delivery-02-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "delivery-03",
    "text": "ನಾನು ಗೇಟ್ ಹತ್ತಿರ ಇದ್ದೇನೆ.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "375466bbae349a851c71d898081c6d1d0083c7e73f657f7b0056ae2425865979",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/delivery-03.mp3",
      "assets/audio/delivery-03-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "delivery-04",
    "text": "ಎರಡನೇ ಮಹಡಿಗೆ ಬನ್ನಿ.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "29e87d45bb28df8ff33ee852faec7930089f48bae334c0c4858d6dd6bb18fac5",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/delivery-04.mp3",
      "assets/audio/delivery-04-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "delivery-05",
    "text": "ನೀವು ಬಂದಿದ್ದೀರಾ?",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "6165786535f8b9ac63e03aa8671093610bb93d42bcdc1a616876ba3edf6b1934",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/delivery-05.mp3",
      "assets/audio/delivery-05-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "delivery-06",
    "text": "ಒಂದು ನಿಮಿಷ ಕಾಯಿರಿ.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "3678cc1274fbc301574ebd22b76aafa223b41e44d2fc16dbd2dada089ed11dc3",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/delivery-06.mp3",
      "assets/audio/delivery-06-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "delivery-07",
    "text": "ನಾನು ಕೆಳಗೆ ಬರುತ್ತಿದ್ದೇನೆ.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "ae34b358ff1d112b66f720533f58a9f3d6696dc7f7d3286ccf5695ee3fb86c2f",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/delivery-07.mp3",
      "assets/audio/delivery-07-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "delivery-08",
    "text": "ಪಾರ್ಸೆಲ್ ಇಲ್ಲಿ ಕೊಡಿ.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
    "textSha256": "c825053bfc60ee74c1ba4d43584f493b86b6ecf1ae73f086b15b8e73a831ee86",
    "files": [
      "assets/audio/delivery-08.mp3",
      "assets/audio/delivery-08-slow.mp3"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "delivery-09",
    "text": "ನಾನು ಹಣ ಕೊಟ್ಟಿದ್ದೇನೆ.",
    "voice": "kn-IN-SapnaNeural",
